That is a stronger name.

The four primitives are really functioning together as a filesystem kernel rather than independent services.


---

YGGDRASIL PATCH — JFS FOUNDATION

Name

JFS = Jarvis File System

Purpose

JFS is the foundational filesystem architecture for all Yggdrasil-compatible systems.

JFS defines:

naming

identity

structure

mirroring


Everything else in the architecture builds on top of JFS.


---

JFS COMPONENTS

JNS — Jarvis Naming System

Function

Defines:

> What something is called.



Responsibilities

Semantic file naming

Log naming

System naming

Version naming


